        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Hidden Ivies\n- Companies: Amherst College, Bowdoin College, Swarthmore College, Wesleyan University, Williams College, Haverford College, Northwestern University\n- People: Eddie George\n- Places: Pennsylvania\n\nFacts:\n- The book Hidden Ivies names Amherst College, Bowdoin College, Swarthmore College, Wesleyan University, Williams College, and Haverford College as the \"Little Ivies.\"\n- Haverford College is a private school in Pennsylvania.\n- Eddie George earned an MBA from Northwestern University.\n- The statement that Eddie George's MBA institution is a private school in Pennsylvania is incorrect because Northwestern University is a private school in Illinois.",
